# Shipping surfaces

Do not advertise a GitHub DMG as the Mac install path. Apple blocks unsigned internet downloads until someone notarizes. The honest path is clone + `pnpm package:mac` on that Mac (`#mac-app`). A Releases `.dmg` is optional and must not be the menu/README primary link.

Do not merge to `main` without a pull request. `.github/workflows/ci.yml` must run `pnpm lint`, `pnpm typecheck`, and `pnpm test` on every PR.

`scripts/shipping-contract.test.mjs` must stay red if those workflows disappear or stop publishing the DMG.

Version lives in the lockstep files. `pnpm package:mac` and Release build that number. They do not increment it. Do not add a bump command or workflow. Do not edit only one of package.json / tauri.conf.json / Cargo.toml / Cargo.lock / `APP_VERSION`.
